OL,4,CWhite House removes cyber-security     
OL,5,Cchief after series of tech outages     
OL,6,GThe top cyber-security official in the 
OL,7,GUS government is leaving his post      
OL,8,Gafter a little over a year in the job. 
OL,10,FWhite House National Cyber Director    
OL,11,FSean Cairncross was fired after losing 
OL,12,Fthe confidence of the White House      
OL,13,Fchief of staff, Stephen Miller,        
OL,14,Faccording CBS, the BBC's US news       
OL,15,Fpartner. Asked about his removal on    
OL,16,FFriday, President Donald Trump said it 
OL,17,Fwas because he was not "good enough".  
OL,19,FHis firing comes after a string of     
OL,20,Ftech outages which hit banking, air    
OL,21,Ftraffic control and other sectors.     
